 6)\f1\tab\f0 The 1976 release of P?S/8\f1  [Version 8P]\f0  does not support the \f1\tab\f0 FILMAN utility; certain \f1 necessary internal \f0 features\f1  \f0 of the \f1\tab\f0 keyboard monitor were not\f1  \f0 available until developed years later.\par
