 7)\f1\tab\f0 The 1976 release of P?S/8\f1  [Version 8P]\f0  uses the VARY \f1 program\f0  to \f1\tab\f0 perform most of the\f1  functions of the SET utility\f0 ; the \f1 commmand \tab\f0 syntax is generally \f1 similar\f0  [if a\f1 pplicable\f0 ].  VARY /A can be\par
