    .BATCH FOO FOOBAR\par
\par
\f1\tab This \f0 will put the keyboard monitor into automatic line numbering \f1\tab\f0 mode; the text\f1  \f0 contents of the file FOO\f1 BAR\f0  will be used to create \f1\tab\f0 a complete file in the \f1 edit\f0  buffer.\par
